# HDin runs entirely in the browser — no API keys and no environment variables are required.
#
# Every image is processed locally via the Canvas 2D API and is never uploaded
# to any server. You can deploy this project to Vercel (or any static host)
# without configuring a single environment variable.
#
# This file exists purely as a reference for future extension (e.g. if you
# later decide to add a server-side AI enhancement API).

# PUBLIC_APP_NAME: Optional branding override used by some deployments.
# PUBLIC_APP_NAME="HDin"
